              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Longbow, hand weapon, and light armour. May wear heavy armour (+2 pts). May have a hand and a half sword (+2 pts, treat as halberd). If not in a Combined Formation or Mixed Order, may have Stakes (+20 pts per unit) or be in Open Order (free). One unit may be Veteran (+1 pt). Ordonnance Longbowmen may be in a Combined Formation with Ordonnance Pikemen. One unit of Archers/Ordonnance Longbowmen or Handgunners may be skirmishers for every 1,000 army points. (Armies of Chivalry p.61)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="b382-d632-5c1a-4259" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
