              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Pike and heavy armour. May have a buckler (+1 pt). Ordonnance Pikemen are a Medieval Phalanx if not in a Combined Formation (with Ordonnance Longbowmen). (Armies of Chivalry p.61)</characteristic>
