            <profile id="e734-4983-3056-339f" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Light artillery range 36", Strength 6. Artillery: up to one gun for every 1,000 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). One model per gun may be upgraded to Master Gunner. Up to one gun for every 500 army points. May upgrade one crewman in the army to a Master Gunner (+20 pts). (Armies of Chivalry p.61)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="7973-bb53-da19-723f" name="Artillery (Chivalry)" hidden="false" targetId="dfeb-8f7d-cb3d-409f" type="rule"/>
